{"title":"Career Roadmap · Technical Writer","role":"Technical Writer","summary":"A Technical Writer transforms complex technical information into clear, accurate, structured documentation for software, engineering, healthcare, finance, hardware, and other technical products. The role combines writing + research + information architecture + technical understanding + documentation tools.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"English Literature"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Timeline","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"English, research and technical communication"}],[{"text":"Skill Building"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Documentation, Markdown, APIs and tools"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Software/product documentation"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Technical Writing Intern / Junior Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Product and developer documentation"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Complex technical documentation"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Documentation architecture and leadership"}],[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"8–15 years"},{"text":"Documentation team/product-content management"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Documentation strategy and information architecture"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Writing foundation"},{"text":"Grammar, research, editing, literature analysis"},{"text":"Writing portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Technical communication"},{"text":"Markdown, Git, documentation structure"},{"text":"Documentation projects"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Technical specialisation"},{"text":"APIs, software concepts, docs tools"},{"text":"Technical writing internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional readiness"},{"text":"API docs, information architecture, analytics, AI tools"},{"text":"Portfolio + capstone"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — English & Communication Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"English Literature provides an excellent foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced reading"},{"text":"Critical analysis"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Vocabulary"},{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Argument development"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But a Technical Writer needs to add technical literacy to this foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop writing skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concise writing"},{"text":"Active voice"},{"text":"Clear instructions"},{"text":"Sentence restructuring"},{"text":"Technical definitions"},{"text":"Summarisation"},{"text":"Copy editing"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Fact checking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important principle"},{"type":"p","text":"Technical writing is usually not about sounding sophisticated."},{"type":"p","text":"It is about making information:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clear","Accurate","Consistent","Findable","Usable"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Technical Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Start learning how technology products work."},{"type":"h","text":"Basic technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operating systems"},{"text":"Web applications"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"Software development lifecycle"},{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"Basic programming concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a full-time software developer, but technical understanding substantially improves technical documentation quality."},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Markdown"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub/GitLab"},{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS basics"},{"text":"Documentation websites"},{"text":"Static site generators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools/platforms may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub"},{"text":"GitBook"},{"text":"Confluence"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Docusaurus"},{"text":"MkDocs"},{"text":"ReadMe"},{"text":"Swagger/OpenAPI documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tool preferences vary by employer."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Technical Writing Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop capability in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product documentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User guides"},{"text":"Installation guides"},{"text":"Configuration guides"},{"text":"Troubleshooting guides"},{"text":"FAQs"},{"text":"Knowledge bases"},{"text":"Release notes"},{"text":"Product manuals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Developer documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"API reference"},{"text":"API tutorials"},{"text":"Authentication documentation"},{"text":"SDK documentation"},{"text":"Code examples"},{"text":"Request/response documentation"},{"text":"Error documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"API example"},{"type":"p","text":"A technical writer should be able to turn a technical API specification into:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Endpoint","Purpose","Authentication","Parameters","Request","Response","Errors","Example"]},{"type":"h","text":"Information Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to organise large amounts of information."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation hierarchy"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Taxonomy"},{"text":"Content models"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Searchability"},{"text":"Cross-linking"},{"text":"Content reuse"},{"text":"Versioning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A technically correct document is not enough if users cannot find the information they need."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key Skills","Career Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Software Documentation"},{"text":"Software + docs"},{"text":"Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"API Documentation"},{"text":"APIs + developer tools"},{"text":"API Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Developer Documentation"},{"text":"SDKs, APIs, Git"},{"text":"Developer Documentation"}],[{"text":"SaaS Documentation"},{"text":"Product workflows"},{"text":"Product Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Engineering Documentation"},{"text":"Engineering concepts"},{"text":"Engineering Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Cybersecurity Documentation"},{"text":"Security concepts"},{"text":"Security Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Cloud Documentation"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP"},{"text":"Cloud Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Medical Documentation"},{"text":"Healthcare terminology"},{"text":"Medical Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"Documentation UX"},{"text":"IA + UX"},{"text":"Documentation UX Writer"}],[{"text":"Knowledge Management"},{"text":"Enterprise content"},{"text":"Knowledge Manager"}],[{"text":"Documentation Management"},{"text":"Leadership + strategy"},{"text":"Documentation Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Best internship targets"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Software product companies"},{"text":"IT services companies"},{"text":"Developer-tool companies"},{"text":"Cloud companies"},{"text":"Cybersecurity companies"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Engineering companies"},{"text":"Technical consulting firms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical Writing Intern"},{"text":"Documentation Intern"},{"text":"Content Intern — Technical"},{"text":"Documentation Specialist Intern"},{"text":"Knowledge Management Intern"},{"text":"Product Documentation Intern"},{"text":"Developer Documentation Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Internship Project"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Complete Product Documentation System\""},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a simple technical product such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST API"},{"text":"Web application"},{"text":"SaaS platform"},{"text":"Mobile application"},{"text":"Developer library"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product overview"},{"text":"Getting started guide"},{"text":"Installation guide"},{"text":"User guide"},{"text":"API documentation"},{"text":"Configuration guide"},{"text":"Troubleshooting guide"},{"text":"FAQ"},{"text":"Glossary"},{"text":"Release notes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Publish the portfolio through a documentation website or GitHub repository."},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates real documentation ability, rather than just essay-writing ability."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are optional; a strong documentation portfolio is generally more important for entry-level hiring."},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Markdown"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"OpenAPI/Swagger"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic programming"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical editing"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Content design"},{"text":"UX writing"},{"text":"Documentation testing"},{"text":"Style guides"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with several:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub"},{"text":"Confluence"},{"text":"GitBook"},{"text":"Docusaurus"},{"text":"MkDocs"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Figma"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not attempt to master every tool. Learn the concepts and become highly proficient in a few."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible entry roles include:"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Technical Writing Intern"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Junior Technical Writer"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Documentation Specialist"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Technical Content Writer"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Product Documentation Writer"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Knowledge Base Writer"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"Documentation Associate"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"API Documentation Writer"},{"text":"Entry"}],[{"text":"UX Writer — Technical Products"},{"text":"Entry/Junior"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is technical writing?"},{"text":"How is technical writing different from content writing?"},{"text":"How would you explain an API to a non-technical user?"},{"text":"What makes good documentation?"},{"text":"What is Markdown?"},{"text":"What is Git?"},{"text":"What is an API?"},{"text":"What is REST?"},{"text":"What is JSON?"},{"text":"How would you document a software installation process?"},{"text":"How do you verify technical information?"},{"text":"How do you work with engineers?"},{"text":"What would you do if two SMEs provide conflicting information?"},{"text":"How would you improve poorly written documentation?"},{"text":"How would you structure documentation for a new software product?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory to become a Technical Writer."},{"type":"p","text":"If pursuing higher education, useful options include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA English"},{"text":"MA English Literature"},{"text":"MA Communication"},{"text":"MA Mass Communication"},{"text":"MA Journalism"},{"text":"MA Technical Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA — for a stronger software/technical route"},{"text":"MSc Computer Science — where eligible"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Technical Communication"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Digital Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Product Management"},{"text":"MBA Technology Management"},{"text":"MBA Marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For technical writing, portfolio + technical literacy + documentation experience can be more valuable than a generic postgraduate qualification."},{"type":"h","text":"Government/Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Technical communication skills can be useful in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government technology organisations"},{"text":"Public-sector enterprises"},{"text":"Research organisations"},{"text":"Engineering organisations"},{"text":"Defence technology organisations"},{"text":"Scientific institutions"},{"text":"Government digital services"},{"text":"Public-sector documentation teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"User manuals"},{"text":"Standard operating procedures"},{"text":"Research documentation"},{"text":"Training materials"},{"text":"Software documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recruitment requirements vary by organisation, so verify current official eligibility for each position."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical Communication"},{"text":"Professional Communication"},{"text":"Information Design"},{"text":"User Experience"},{"text":"Digital Communication"},{"text":"Information Science"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Content Strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Countries to consider"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Ireland"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International career opportunities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical Writer"},{"text":"API Documentation Specialist"},{"text":"Developer Documentation Specialist"},{"text":"Content Designer"},{"text":"Information Architect"},{"text":"Documentation UX Specialist"},{"text":"Knowledge Manager"},{"text":"Documentation Manager"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Stage 1 — Entry"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Technical Writer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product documentation"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"SME interviews"},{"text":"Markdown"},{"text":"Documentation tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 2 — Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Writer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"End-to-end documentation"},{"text":"API documentation"},{"text":"Release documentation"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Product knowledge"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 3 — Senior"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Technical Writer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complex products"},{"text":"Documentation architecture"},{"text":"Style guides"},{"text":"Cross-team collaboration"},{"text":"Mentoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 4 — Specialist/Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Technical Writer / Documentation Lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation strategy"},{"text":"Team leadership"},{"text":"Documentation quality"},{"text":"Developer experience"},{"text":"Content systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stage 5 — Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Manager"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team"},{"text":