"type":"p","text":"The focus becomes:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Can users successfully complete the task?\""},{"type":"p","text":"rather than simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Is the documentation grammatically correct?\""},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Route 4 — Developer Experience"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technical Writer","Developer Writer","Developer Experience Specialist","Developer Experience Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"SDKs"},{"text":"CLI tools"},{"text":"GitHub"},{"text":"Tutorials"},{"text":"Quickstarts"},{"text":"Sample applications"},{"text":"Developer portals"},{"text":"Documentation analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This route can be particularly valuable in SaaS, cloud, AI and developer-platform companies."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Technical Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will automate a significant amount of first-draft documentation, summarisation and content transformation."},{"type":"p","text":"However, strong Technical Writers will increasingly become technical information architects and documentation strategists."},{"type":"h","text":"AI applications"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation drafting"},{"text":"API documentation generation"},{"text":"Content summarisation"},{"text":"Documentation translation"},{"text":"Terminology consistency"},{"text":"Broken-link detection"},{"text":"Documentation gap analysis"},{"text":"Content classification"},{"text":"Semantic search"},{"text":"Documentation chatbots"},{"text":"Knowledge-base generation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Human skills remain critical"},{"type":"p","text":"AI still requires human oversight for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical accuracy"},{"text":"Product understanding"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Risk-sensitive documentation"},{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"SME validation"}]}]},{"heading":"Technical Writer + AI Specialist","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready profile could be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["English Literature","Technical Writing","APIs","Git","Documentation Tools","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RAG-powered documentation assistants"},{"text":"AI documentation search"},{"text":"Automated release-note generation"},{"text":"Documentation quality checkers"},{"text":"AI-powered knowledge bases"},{"text":"Developer support assistants"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a strong bridge between humanities and technology."}]},{"heading":"Documentation Metrics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A senior Technical Writer should understand documentation performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search success rate"},{"text":"Page views"},{"text":"Search queries"},{"text":"Failed searches"},{"text":"Time to information"},{"text":"Documentation feedback"},{"text":"Support-ticket reduction"},{"text":"Content freshness"},{"text":"Broken links"},{"text":"Documentation coverage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A powerful business metric is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documentation Impact = Reduction in Support Effort","Improved Product Adoption","Improved User Success"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Technical documentation is likely to become increasingly:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-generated"},{"text":"Interactive"},{"text":"Context-aware"},{"text":"Personalised"},{"text":"Multimodal"},{"text":"Conversational"},{"text":"Embedded directly into software"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential future roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Documentation Strategist"},{"text":"Documentation Intelligence Manager"},{"text":"Developer Experience Architect"},{"text":"Knowledge Systems Architect"},{"text":"AI Content Operations Manager"},{"text":"Documentation Automation Lead"},{"text":"Information Architecture Director"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professionals will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Writing","Technology","UX","Information Architecture","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"English & Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced writing"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Technical explanation"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Markdown"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"HTTP"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"OpenAPI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic programming"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Content design"},{"text":"UX writing"},{"text":"Style guides"},{"text":"Documentation testing"},{"text":"Knowledge management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Confluence"},{"text":"GitBook"},{"text":"Docusaurus/MkDocs"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Postman"},{"text":"GitHub"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prompt engineering"},{"text":"AI-assisted documentation"},{"text":"RAG concepts"},{"text":"Documentation automation"},{"text":"AI quality verification"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Technical Writing Intern / Junior Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Senior Technical Writer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Lead Technical Writer / Documentation Lead"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Documentation Manager"}],[{"text":"12–16 years"},{"text":"Senior Documentation Manager / Head of Documentation"}],[{"text":"16+ years"},{"text":"Director of Documentation / Content Strategy"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, an ideal candidate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BA English Literature"},{"text":"Excellent written English"},{"text":"Strong research and editing skills"},{"text":"Technical writing portfolio"},{"text":"Markdown proficiency"},{"text":"Git/GitHub familiarity"},{"text":"REST/API fundamentals"},{"text":"JSON and HTTP understanding"},{"text":"Basic HTML/CSS"},{"text":"Documentation-tool experience"},{"text":"Information architecture knowledge"},{"text":"At least one technical writing internship"},{"text":"4–6 polished documentation samples"},{"text":"API documentation project"},{"text":"User-guide project"},{"text":"Troubleshooting/FAQ project"},{"text":"AI-assisted documentation experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"BA English Literature + technical writing portfolio + strong research/editing + Markdown + Git/GitHub + API/REST/JSON fundamentals + documentation tools + information architecture + AI-assisted documentation → Junior Technical Writer → Technical Writer → Senior Technical Writer → Documentation Lead → Documentation Manager → Director of Documentation/Content Strategy."},{"type":"h","text":"1378 | BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours) | English Literature | Translator"}]}]}